  "title": "Google's Gemini AI Expansion and Personalization",
  "summary": "Google introduces a 2-month extended chat retention period for Gemini, allowing users to interact more freely while history is off. The app also features a toggle to separate AI training and chat history, enhancing user control and flexibility.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google extends the Gemini chat retention period from 72 hours to 2 months globally.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Users can opt out of using AI training and chat history separately in the settings.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The update aims to improve user experience and reduce dependency on historical data.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
